          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Destructive Finale"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(evocation, occult, sonic)\n\nThe fiddling bones performs a boisterous finale. They choose a 30-foot cone or 15-foot emanation, and they deal 4d6 sonic damage to all creatures in that area (DC 21 basic Reflex save). Dance with Death immediately ends, and the fiddling bones can't use Dance with Death or Destructive Finale for 1d4 rounds."
            },
